":false,"text":"Hates: Imposing image"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kousuke's blood-related younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A black-haired beauty. People think she has an uptight personality since she always shows a stern expression. But according to Kousuke, she is just very awkward and actually a good-natured person who always pokes her nose into his matters and helps him. She thinks of herself as not very interesting, but that changes whenever she has a conversation with her brother. She mainly communicate with Kousuke through mail ever since she started to live in a school dorm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Kousuke, she doesn't remember much of her childhood."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8524"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dff118758e9a35ab6ea2841b65346442fda7bcbeca32ffd60cbf506720a0e054.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/8756f90d15406727623fc526a85cf6c7ec2a86ac0c261c89dd40870b5ab670ed.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山 紗弥","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25505","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8525","characterName":"岩永 翔子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8525"},"originalCharacterName":"岩永 翔子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"903"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"66"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"31"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Taking care of a certain animal; collecting beautiful stones"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Her mother; Jacos"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hates: Her male classmates"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kousuke's cousin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a gentle personality like her mother, but she is quiet and shy, and rarely speaks to Kousuke. One of Kousuke's \"part-time jobs\" is to help her with her studies, but the awkward relationship makes it difficult. Shouko was very young when they first met before, and she barely remembers him. To her, Kousuke is just an older cousin whom she does not know well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a bright girl back then, and seems like something is troubling her mind recently..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8525"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/759fc562cbe2b454b90f1206a4e9342da6852b5fb3fe8a80c14179eb7a03a139.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/620c4551bf4f15762dbb14b10387d9e7be11768f90689014985ca929274d15b0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏野 こおり","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25500","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8526","characterName":"春日 いろは","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8526"},"originalCharacterName":"春日 いろは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"706"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"65"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Reading, taking a stroll"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Her family work"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hates: No spare time"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A miko of Minakami village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a close childhood friend of Kousuke when he lived at the village. Even now, their families are really close and they still exchange New Year cards every single year. She has a cheerful personality but very strict in her work, and strives to make it the best as possible. She loves her current work, but as a result, she is too busy to go out of the village to play."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The lake behind Kasuga Shrine is legendary place where a Tennyo purified her hagoromo when she came down in the past. Kagura dance performed by Iroha reenacts the story and plays a leading role in the summer festival."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8526"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f62f27885eea8c38be602523f26fe756a174217645dfdd52baf70fb03419e8f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/829a2288650b5f9c8f3b34d27963e3075403796d60948d72bcc34da2683911fc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25502","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8527","characterName":"銀子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8527"},"originalCharacterName":"銀子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1111"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"64"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Playing with Kousuke and children"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: The mountain of Minakami village"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hates: ???"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman with mysterious aura whom Kousuke met when he came to Minakami village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It is unknown whether her name is real or not. She seems to know Kousuke from the past and call him \"Kou-chan\" intimately. A person who acts on impulse. While at the first glance she is a real beauty, she has a quite eccentric personality. She likes to tease and plays pranks on people, especially Kousuke. Even though she teases him with dirty joke and romance a lot, she unexpectedly very shy when he teases her back."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Often caught playing together with the village kids."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems to know a lot about the history of Minakami village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real identity is that she is the youngest sister of Tennyo whom Minakami village worshipped. She came down to earth to clean the mess her sisters left behind. She is also known as Shirogane-sama"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8527"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0424d0bb89fb693297fdb7ee2aa882cc9b55ff1be3b0d9b0e933b245a1865df9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23cffa8511786d7c878dd5a9c516446c484e8dca8869dcce482c4f08aed104cd.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"芹園 みや","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:25506","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8529","characterName":"高見 沙智子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8529"},"originalCharacterName":"高見 沙智子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"704"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shouko's classmate. At first they were got along pretty well, but now Sachiko dislikes her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8529"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/023306a5a22edf59e05cff299ecc3ede58732bde0bb5f6d170